<title>USA: MBIA has capacity for WPPSS projects 1, 2 and 3.</title>
<headline>MBIA has capacity for WPPSS projects 1, 2 and 3.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Thursday it has remaining secondary market insurance capacity for Washington Public Power Supply System nuclear projects 1, 2 and 3.</p>
<p>The limited capacity will be available on a first-come, first-served basis, MBIA said. For more information, call 800-624-2669.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
